[ceiling] Each flat pull roof joins the fore and aft ends of a rounded grip pocket. Its underside spans 15 by 18 mm at Z272.865, including the 0.25 mm supported-face allowance from `_pull_z_span`. The surrounding cartridge body carries the roof, and removable support leaves through the open side before the pumps are installed.
